e the item held for a further 7 days.\",\"line\":17,\"span\":\"A borrower who asks before the 7 days are up can have the item held for a further 7 days.\"},{\"text\":\"The further 7-day hold extension is granted once per request.\",\"line\":17,\"span\":\"This is granted once per request.\"},{\"text\":\"An item that has been on the hold shelf twice without being collected goes back to the shelves.\",\"line\":21,\"span\":\"An item that has been on the hold shelf twice without being collected goes back to the shelves and the request is cancelled, so the borrower needs to reserve it again.\"},{\"text\":\"When an item has been on the hold shelf twice without being collected, the request is cancelled.\",\"line\":21,\"span\":\"An item that has been on the hold shelf twice without being collected goes back to the shelves and the request is cancelled, so the borrower needs to reserve it again.\"},{\"text\":\"When an item has been on the hold shelf twice without being collected, the borrower needs to reserve the item again.\",\"line\":21,\"span\":\"An item that has been on the hold shelf twice without being collected goes back to the shelves and the request is cancelled, so the borrower needs to reserve it again.\"}]}","ttft_ms":9562,"type":"result","duration_ms":9601,"uuid":"c89dbae6-ac29-405d-b7b0-77a02cb8144c","ttft_stream_ms":1476,"time_to_request_ms":108,"first_content_frame_ms":1477,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
